00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:52.250
here-- they're there.

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:52.920
Look at that.

00:06:52.920 --> 00:06:53.150
OK.

00:06:53.150 --> 00:06:55.160
So now what I've done, I've
got a liquid and a solid.

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:56.780
And in both cases,
there's a liquid.

00:06:56.780 --> 00:06:57.830
You could have solid.

00:06:57.830 --> 00:06:59.330
Molecules can come off.

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:00.160
We'll get to that.

00:07:00.160 --> 00:07:00.660
How?

00:07:00.660 --> 00:07:01.820
Why?

00:07:01.820 --> 00:07:03.630
They can come off.

