00:07:22.142 --> 00:07:23.050
Right.

00:07:23.050 --> 00:07:24.130
OK.

00:07:24.130 --> 00:07:26.770
So evaporation went that way.

00:07:26.770 --> 00:07:28.580
Condensation went that way.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:33.280
Now-- ah-- now,
if I were to plot,

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:39.010
if I were to close this and
plot, for example, a rate.

00:07:39.010 --> 00:07:42.370
And I say, well, I want to
