00:13:25.230 --> 00:13:30.060
But I still have not
come back to boiling.

00:13:30.060 --> 00:13:31.320
And that really is it.

00:13:31.320 --> 00:13:37.890
It's that boiling is actually
understood by vapor pressure.

00:13:37.890 --> 00:13:40.380
That is how we
understand boiling.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:42.200
And so you can think
about it-- let's just

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:42.990
give it to you conceptually.

00:13:42.990 --> 00:13:43.490
Right.

00:13:43.490 --> 00:13:46.260
So if you had--

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:48.012
let's go back to
those buckets there.

00:13:48.012 --> 00:13:49.470
Think of it-- we'll
go back to like

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:50.730
