00:14:00.420 --> 00:14:02.850
And I've got all
these waters in it.

00:14:02.850 --> 00:14:04.830
Right.

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.150
But now I'm outside.

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:10.020
So I've got the power of
